# Policy (2026-07-11): PAID / non-trivially-recomputable outputs are COMMITTED so a
# working tree loss doesn't destroy $0.24+/roll Vertex spend (a paint.png was overwritten
# with no frozen copy before this policy existed — see gen12/TODO.md). $0-deterministic
# or freely-relocal artifacts stay ignored. Committed: assets-*/joint-4k.png (paid Vertex
# roll), assets-*/paint.png (paid), assets-*/mask.png (paid alpha), assets-*_biref/*.png
# (BiRefNet cut sprites — $0 to recompute now that BIREF_LOCAL=True, but player.html loads
# them at runtime from ../assets-<theme>_biref/, so they're runtime-required, not scratch).
assets-*/overlay.png
assets-*/blueprint.png
__pycache__/
.venv-biref/
review.json
pbrtest/pydeps/
assets-*/observe/*.png
assets-*/director/*.png
.director-drive-*.mjs
